			] </font></span></font>
			</p>
		</td>
	</tr>
	<tr>
		<td bgcolor="#ffffff" style="background: #ffffff; border: none; padding: 0cm"><h5 class="cjk">
			<font face="Liberation Serif, serif"><span lang="en-US"><font face="Liberation Serif, serif">Originally
			added to <a href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/browse/ECSL2-42977">ECSL2-42977</a>
			at 07/May/25 10:42 PM</font></span></font></h5>
			<ol>
				<li><p style="margin-bottom: 0.5cm">海光<font face="Liberation Serif, serif"><span lang="en-US"><font face="Liberation Serif, serif">CPU
				</font></span></font>，<font face="Liberation Serif, serif"><span lang="en-US"><font face="Liberation Serif, serif">611</font></span></font>升级到<font face="Liberation Serif, serif"><span lang="en-US"><font face="Liberation Serif, serif">621</font></span></font>，到了节点重启阶段，客户将未重启过的节点上虚机热迁移到已重启过的节点，发现虚机宕机，涉及的虚机大部分是麒麟<font face="Liberation Serif, serif"><span lang="en-US"><font face="Liberation Serif, serif">OS</font></span></font>，另外还有<font face="Liberation Serif, serif"><span lang="en-US"><font face="Liberation Serif, serif">2</font></span></font>个云产品节点
				<font face="Liberation Serif, serif"><span lang="en-US"><font face="Liberation Serif, serif">node-29</font></span></font>和<font face="Liberation Serif, serif"><span lang="en-US"><font face="Liberation Serif, serif">node-30</font></span></font>。<font face="Liberation Serif, serif"><span lang="en-US"><font face="Liberation Serif, serif">node-29</font></span></font>和<font face="Liberation Serif, serif"><span lang="en-US"><font face="Liberation Serif, serif">node-30</font></span></font>位于节点
				<font face="Liberation Serif, serif"><span lang="en-US"><font face="Liberation Serif, serif">node-43</font></span></font>上面。
								</p></li>
				<li><p style="margin-bottom: 0.5cm">查看出问题的麒麟虚机<font face="Liberation Serif, serif"><span lang="en-US"><font face="Liberation Serif, serif">VNC</font></span></font>，发现有
				“<font face="Liberation Serif, serif"><span lang="en-US"><font face="Liberation Serif, serif">soft
				lockup“ “CPU stuck“</font></span></font>的日志打印。与研发确认是由于虚机时钟突然偏移过大，导致<font face="Liberation Serif, serif"><span lang="en-US"><font face="Liberation Serif, serif">CPU</font></span></font>软锁。<font face="Liberation Serif, serif"><span lang="en-US"><font face="Liberation Serif, serif"><br/>
</font><font color="#000000"><font face="Liberation Serif, serif"><font color="#000000">
  <img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/353945" name="图像3" alt="企业微信截图_17466115012255-20250507-095141.png" align="bottom" width="1190" height="394" border="1"/>
</font>

				</font></font></span></font>
				</p></li>
			</ol>
			<ol>
				<li><p style="margin-bottom: 0.5cm">已确认虚机所在物理机时间是正常的，不清楚为什么虚机在热迁移之后时钟突然偏移这么大的原因。已通过命令收集虚机<font face="Liberation Serif, serif"><span lang="en-US"><font face="Liberation Serif, serif">coredump</font></span></font>，交给麒麟<font face="Liberation Serif, serif"><span lang="en-US"><font face="Liberation Serif, serif">OS</font></span></font>厂商分析。
								</p>
				<pre class="cjk"><span style="display: inline-block; border: none; padding: 0cm"><span lang="en-US"><font face="Liberation Mono, monospace"><font face="Liberation Mono, monospace">virsh dump --domain </font></span></font>《虚机<font face="Liberation Mono, monospace"><span lang="en-US"><font face="Liberation Mono, monospace">id</font></span></font>（<font face="Liberation Mono, monospace"><span lang="en-US"><font face="Liberation Mono, monospace">instance-xxxxxxxx</font></span></font>）》 <font face="Liberation Mono, monospace"><span lang="en-US"><font face="Liberation Mono, monospace">--verbose --memory-only --format=kdump-zlib /root/guest_coredump.zlib</font></span></span></font></pre></li>
			</ol>
		</td>
	</tr>
</table>
